{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03813","headline":"咏雾 · 董思恭","name":"咏雾","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"苍山寂已暮，翠观黯将沈。\n终南晨豹隐，巫峡夜猿吟。\n天寒气不歇，景晦色方深。\n待访公超市，将予赴华阴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"董思恭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03813.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03813","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}